# Always push after changes

When you finish implementing a feature, bugfix, or UI change that the user needs to see on production:

1. Commit the relevant files (unless the user said not to commit).
2. Immediately `git push origin HEAD` **and** `git push djapps HEAD`.
3. Do not wait for the user to say „pushni to“.

This project deploys from GitHub; unpushed local changes are invisible on bookthevibe.com.
